  <p class="eyebrow">Paglyph for iPhone</p>
  <h1>Your next chapter<br />starts here.</h1>
  <p class="intro">We’re getting Paglyph ready for you. The download link will be available here when it’s ready.</p>
  <p>For availability or early-access questions, <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}?subject=Paglyph%20availability`}>get in touch</a>.</p>
  <a class="download-button" href="/">Back to Paglyph</a>
